THIRD PARTY SOFTWARE REDISTRIBUTED BY THIS PROJECT
==================================================

Exactly one file in this product is somebody else's binary shipped inside ours.
Its licence requires its notice to be included with any copy of it, so the
notice is here, in the file that travels with every copy of this product.

The four lines below are the ones BCD3000Setup.exe itself prints, spelled
identically on purpose: installer/verify asserts that every line of the notice
the program emits also occurs in this file, so the two statements of the same
permission cannot drift into disagreeing.

Windows.Devices.Midi2.dll - Windows MIDI Services
https://github.com/microsoft/MIDI
